{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16206230","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16206230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1620623001:0":{"text":"嗯……我刚才说到哪了？","source_cn":"嗯……我刚才说到哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040C92B7829DD9E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1620623001":{"text":"嗯……我刚才说到哪了？","source_cn":"嗯……我刚才说到哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040C92B7829DD9E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620623002:1":{"text":"我的过去……如果必须回忆的话，就和你们讲讲吧。","source_cn":"我的过去……如果必须回忆的话，就和你们讲讲吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C53F6C9CF30D258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620623003:0":{"text":"我的青春全都献给了学术，毕业后顺理成章成为一名老师。我很骄傲能以这样的身份留在莱希拉姆。","source_cn":"我的青春全都献给了学术，毕业后顺理成章成为一名老师。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC47E3BDDD94672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620623004:0":{"text":"也是从那一刻起，我立志要成为一名好老师……可还没等我这个新人有足够的时间去思考，事情就逐渐走向了极端。","source_cn":"也是从那一刻起，我立志要成为一名好老师……可还没等我这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2D103B764B64BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_