","hash_xxh64":"0x96EF3BF225EA1F35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620623009:1":{"text":"真实的……我……？也许你说得对，本来的我并不是这样的。","source_cn":"真实的……我……？也许你说得对，本来的我并不是这样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x234877D48EC8750A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620623012:1":{"text":"而我接下来的余生……都奉献给了教育事业。","source_cn":"而我接下来的余生……都奉献给了教育事业。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB5ABCBFCF0FF27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620623013:0":{"text":"可我的严苛，却给学生们带来了不可逆的压力……这是我最大的遗憾。","source_cn":"可我的严苛，却给学生们带来了不可逆的压力……这是我最大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB663EFBF43B4E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620623014:1":{"text":"这是我最大的遗憾。","source_cn":"这是我最大的遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17FFD2ED3E792B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1620623014":{"text":"这是我最大的遗憾。","source_cn":"这是我最大的遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17FFD2ED3E792B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620623015:1":{"text":"你的话让人感到温暖……谢谢你。","source_cn":"你的话让人感到温暖……谢谢你。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB587340DD1B81072","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你的话让人感到温暖……谢谢你。","female":"你的话让人感到温暖……谢谢你。","variant_male_record_index":"213857","variant_female_record_index":"213858","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620623016:1":{"text":"但我的学生们，又会怎么想呢？","source_cn":"但我的学生们，又会怎么想呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DD7058AAC4026D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620623018:0":{"text":"我曾经最好的学生，因为压力而昏厥，那一刻我才意识到自己酿成了无法挽回的错误。","source_cn":"我曾经最好的学生，因为压力而昏厥，那一刻我才意识到自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4AF5E113D7B3EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1620623019:0":{"text":"我倒觉得……那位昏厥的学生，不一定是因为压力。","source_cn":"我倒觉得……那位昏厥的学生，不一定是因为压力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0C52935295A90C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1620623020:1":{"text":"有些人天生就热爱学术……比如我，我经常废寝忘食地研究魔法。","source_cn":"有些人天生就热爱学术……比如我，我经常废寝忘食地研究魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1207A70BB9B023FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1620623021:1":{"text":"是啊，这我知道。你这种为了学习连饭都忘吃的人……哪天真晕倒了，我都不会意外。","source_cn":"是啊，这我知道。你这种为了学习连饭都忘吃的人……哪天真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6436E231F7B52D5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1620623022:1":{"text":"你们说……不是因为压力？","source_cn":"你们说……不是因为压力？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D3D2503ED12604F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1620623023:1":{"text":"是的。老师，你也是热爱学术的人，应该能理解那种狂热的感觉吧？","source_cn":"是的。老师，你也是热爱学术的人，应该能理解那种狂热的感觉吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A8EC0D9F031D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1620623024:1":{"text":"我……的确是这样的人。","source_cn":"我……的确是这样的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CBBA0EAA2D30EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1620623024":{"text":"我……的确是这样的人。","source_cn":"我……的确是这样的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CBBA0EAA2D30EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1620623025:1":{"text":"说得对！这句话我认同！","source_cn":"说得对！这句话我认同！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8B02336D16A2F7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1620623026:1":{"text":"没错！与年龄无关，青春是个人的浪漫，不断地碰壁与突破，我喜欢这种感觉！","source_cn":"没错！与年龄无关，青春是个人的浪漫，不断地碰壁与突破，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB151C0805BA109CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1620623029:1":{"text":"一个想当好老师，一个想当好学生……我斗胆猜测一下，回声不会是你激活的吧？洛兰！","source_cn":"一个想当好老师，一个想当好学生……我斗胆猜测一下，回声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD88777674B91837B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1620623030:1":{"text":"我……是我吗？","source_cn":"我……是我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41D1D31DC2A5DDCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1620623031:1":{"text":"还能有谁？你在自习室连夜待了多少天了。","source_cn":"还能有谁？你在自习室连夜待了多少天了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71DD5AB3D80C390A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1620623032:1":{"text":"我劝过你多少次，可你为了解开那几道题还是一头钻回去……这不正是一种执念吗？","source_cn":"我劝过你多少次，可你为了解开那几道题还是一头钻回去……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70D048DC4ADAA244","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1620623033:1":{"text":"的确……我在你身上感受到了一种和我相似的情感。执着，还有……迷茫。","source_cn":"的确……我在你身上感受到了一种和我相似的情感。执着，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3834ECE63E38DF2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1620623034:1":{"text":"对魔法师来说，这是危险的。如果不妥当处理，你很可能会走上和我一样的老路。","source_cn":"对魔法师来说，这是危险的。如果不妥当处理，你很可能会走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0952953E12A3DDE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1620623035:1":{"text":"哈哈，也就是说，最后洛兰也会成为教学楼的幽灵吗？总会回到这里复习功课。","source_cn":"哈哈，也就是说，最后洛兰也会成为教学楼的幽灵吗？总会回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBDC5C8C602E893B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1620623036:1":{"text":"班克西，你当着莫温老师的面这样讲话是不是有点无礼了……","source_cn":"班克西，你当着莫温老师的面这样讲话是不是有点无礼了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49F001884BC58923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1620623037:1":{"text":"啊……对不起，我没有恶意。","source_cn":"啊……对不起，我没有恶意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DB0DA2B74CF491E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","documen